{"4780410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Esurient", "steam_appid": 4780410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras/6d084a2cf00d6ec8aede43a1626fafa8.avif?t=1784987961\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras_big/6d084a2cf00d6ec8aede43a1626fafa8.webp?t=1784987961 width=1560 height=766 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bygone conflict scars the desolate land, now relieved by wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dormant machines across the land rise again, still bound to their former purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within you, stirs a tumultuous hunger…  a bestial impulse to devour drives your every movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vortex of instinct and survival, yours is but a small journey that plants a seed for the coming new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras/45bbb69206e3f40a51879f77d916f0af.poster.avif?t=1784987961\" width=508 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras/45bbb69206e3f40a51879f77d916f0af.webm?t=1784987961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras/45bbb69206e3f40a51879f77d916f0af.mp4?t=1784987961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat combining nimble maneuvers and hefty swings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mist-veiled world of great structures, lone tunnels, and decaying waste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various creatures adapted to their environments, and machines who have long dwelled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss fights, whose limbs can be broken individually to gain an advantage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras/2588ed3be05cf16cd7939d0fd58d9288.poster.avif?t=1784987961\" width=508 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras/2588ed3be05cf16cd7939d0fd58d9288.webm?t=1784987961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras/2588ed3be05cf16cd7939d0fd58d9288.mp4?t=1784987961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras/6d084a2cf00d6ec8aede43a1626fafa8.avif?t=1784987961\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780410/extras_big/6d084a2cf00d6ec8aede43a1626fafa8.webp?t=1784987961 width=1560 height=766 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bygone conflict scars the desolate land, now relieved by wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dormant machines across the land rise again, still bound to their former purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within you, stirs a tumultuous hunger…  a bestial impulse to devour drives your every movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vortex of instinct and survival, yours is but a small journey that plants a seed for the coming n